---
---

<section id="faq-industries" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-canvas relative overflow-hidden border-t border-hairline">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Industries Section -->
    <div class="mb-20">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/50 backdrop-blur-md mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-mute tracking-wider uppercase">Industries We Serve</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-sans font-extralight tracking-[-0.02em] text-white mb-6">
        Specialized Web Solutions for Local Growth.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-body text-pretty max-w-3xl mb-10">
        As a premier website developer company, Shyamika AI understands that different local businesses need tailored digital strategies. We don't just build generic pages; we deliver specialized website developer services near me and across the US, ensuring your industry-specific needs are met with precision.
      </p>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- HVAC -->
        <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 hover:bg-canvas-soft/60 transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">HVAC Website Design</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-mute">
            Looking for the best HVAC website design? We build high-converting platforms that capture emergency leads instantly. As a dedicated HVAC website design company, we ensure your site is fast, reliable, and outranks local competitors.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Roofing -->
        <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 hover:bg-canvas-soft/60 transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Roofing Website Design</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-mute">
            Turn roof damage searches into booked inspections. Partner with the best roofing website design agency to create trust-building portfolios and lead-generation funnels tailored specifically for roofing website design.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Medical -->
        <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 hover:bg-canvas-soft/60 transition-colors">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Healthcare & Clinics</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-mute">
            Patient trust starts online. Our medical website redesign services ensure HIPAA-compliant structures, accessible patient portals, and a modern aesthetic that puts patients at ease before they ever step into your waiting room.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <div class="mt-32">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/50 backdrop-blur-md mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-mute tracking-wider uppercase">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-sans font-extralight tracking-[-0.02em] text-white mb-12">
        Common Questions About Custom Web Development.
      </h2>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-5xl">
        <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>What is a custom website?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            A custom website is a digital platform built specifically from scratch to meet the unique needs, goals, and branding of a business. Unlike template-based sites, it offers tailored functionality, bespoke design, and scalable architecture optimized for performance and user experience.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>What custom website development services are there?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            Custom website development services encompass a wide range of solutions, including front-end and back-end development, UI/UX design, e-commerce solutions, content management system (CMS) integration, custom web applications, API integrations, and ongoing maintenance and SEO optimization.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>How much does it cost to hire a web designer?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            The cost to hire a web designer varies widely based on their experience, location, and the complexity of your project. Freelance designers might charge anywhere from $50 to $150 per hour, while agency rates can range from $100 to $300+ per hour. A typical custom web design project can cost anywhere from a few thousand dollars to tens of thousands.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>How to hire a website developer?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            To hire a website developer, start by defining your project requirements and budget. You can look for candidates on specialized web development agencies, freelance platforms, or job boards. Review their portfolios, check past client testimonials, conduct technical interviews, and ensure they have strong communication skills and align with your project goals.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 5 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>What's the difference between custom web development and a website builder?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            A website builder provides pre-designed templates with drag-and-drop features, which is quick and cost-effective but limits flexibility, scalability, and unique branding. Custom web development involves coding a site from scratch, offering limitless customization, better performance, enhanced security, and the ability to integrate complex, specific functionalities.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 6 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>What is the cost of a custom website?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            The cost of a custom website depends entirely on its size, complexity, features, and the team you hire. A basic custom informational site might start around $5,000 - $10,000, while complex e-commerce platforms or custom web applications can range from $20,000 to over $100,000. It's an investment in a scalable and unique digital asset.
          </div>
        </details>
        
        <!-- FAQ Item 7 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>How long does it take to build a custom website?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            Typically, building a custom website takes anywhere from 8 to 16 weeks. This timeline includes discovery, design, development, content creation, and testing phases. Complex projects with advanced features or extensive pages will take longer to ensure high quality and optimal performance.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 8 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>Will my website be mobile-friendly and responsive?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed">
            Absolutely. All custom websites we build are fully responsive, meaning they automatically adapt to look and function perfectly on any device, whether it's a desktop computer, tablet, or smartphone. This is crucial for both SEO and user experience.
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ Item 9 -->
        <details class="group glass-card rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft/40 overflow-hidden open:bg-canvas-soft/60 transition-colors md:col-span-2">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-white">
            <span>Do you provide ongoing support and maintenance?</span>
            <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
              <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-mute text-sm p-6 pt-0 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            Yes, we offer comprehensive post-launch support and maintenance plans. This includes regular security updates, performance monitoring, content updates, and technical troubleshooting to ensure your website remains secure, fast, and up-to-date with the latest web standards.
          </div>
        </details>

      </div>
    </div>
    
  </div>

